  "instrumentationLimitations": [
    "The first two probe channels duplicate in.velocity; the third is geometricNormal.y. These values are the intended observations. The alpha injection uses u.weather.z after instance shader rewriting, so instanced geometry observes the representative binding-0 uniform seed rather than the per-instance storage seed. Alpha is excluded from any per-instance input conclusion. The measured shader archive preserves this limitation.",
    "Both outputs use binary16 components. Exact byte agreement is an empirical gate, not a promise that WGSL forbids all independently rounded conversions, signed-zero differences or subnormal handling. No tolerance was introduced and no driver/specification violation is inferred from mismatch alone.",
    "Changing the normal output changes compiler scheduling and subsequent effects. Additional copies, compute dispatches and queue waits also affect GPU scheduling. Finite repeatability cannot certify production stability or competitive visual/performance results."
  ],
